  "verdict": {
    "ko": "같은 실험 구조, 같은 정렬, 같은 판정 기준으로 자체 GPU에서 접은 Boltz-2와 공개 아카이브의 AlphaFold 예측을 나란히 놓으면 confidence 신뢰도가 target마다 다르게 갈린다: 5개 표적 중 3개(1LYZ/3RN3/1UBQ)는 Boltz-2가 잘 접었고 신뢰도도 겸손한 반면(gap 음수), 이황화결합이 많은 나머지 2개(5PTI/1CRN)는 구조가 크게 무너졌는데도 confidence는 절반만 떨어져 과신(gap 양수, ECE 급증)으로 드러난다. 단, 두 predictor는 조건이 다르다. 자체 폴딩은 MSA 없이 단일 서열로 돌았고 아카이브는 full pipeline이라 정확도 자체는 직접 비교 대상이 아니다.",
    "en": "Placing our own in-house-GPU Boltz-2 fold next to the public AlphaFold-DB prediction, against the same experimental structure, the same alignment, and the same threshold, shows confidence reliability split by target: on three of five targets (1LYZ/3RN3/1UBQ) Boltz-2 folds well and stays modestly confident (negative gap); on the two disulfide-rich targets (5PTI/1CRN) the structure collapses far more than its confidence does, showing up as overconfidence (positive gap, ECE spikes). The two predictors ran under different conditions, ours single-sequence, the archive's full pipeline, so raw accuracy is not a fair head-to-head; the confidence-vs-error relationship is the fair one."
  },
  "provenance": {
    "backend": "Real predicted structures on both sides: Boltz-2 folds already committed at data/folded/*_boltz.pdb (run once on in-house GPU, not re-run here) scored against the real RCSB experimental structure; AlphaFold DB predictions and RCSB experimental structures fetched live from the public archives over the network (CPU only, no GPU job). Per-residue error, calibration and RMSD/GDT_TS computed by bioproof.predictor_comparison.score().",
    "command": "cd bioproof-lab && PYTHONPATH=src python scripts/gen_demo_data.py",
    "generated": "2026-08-15",
    "measured": true
  }
}